    "notes": "Linux X11 Computer Pass: bind missing logind Display using kernel X-server peer credentials and exact logind session, preserving active/lock/user checks. Includes beta15 truthful permission refresh on all platforms. Live Linux screenshot, clicking, typing, shortcut, drag, scroll and native Stop passed. Mac/Windows native implementations unchanged from live-tested beta15. Windows unsigned. Preview only, no stable/fleet promotion.",
